{"server":"cn","storyId":"act13side_level_act13side_06_end","groupId":"act13side","stageId":"act13side_06","title":"被包围者","storyCode":"NL-6","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act13side/level_act13side_06_end.txt","sourceHash":"ddc7e555af9af003f81ecd3e601282777ac9676ae15a6d06ebba551b0c2d1cf5","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"索娜成功夺得数据，却被一通电话点醒，原来一切都在无胄盟的掌控中。","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"卡西米尔2 6-2"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"四周变暗了。\n格蕾纳蒂成功了吗？索娜是不是已经成功潜入了？\n......\n成功之后，我们，就能顺利生活在卡西米尔了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰米","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"别骗自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰米","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"想想我们的遭遇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰米","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"在地下竞技场和野兽厮杀，和同伴厮杀，每一场比赛留下的都是实打实的伤痛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰米","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"主办方要看到更多的鲜血和刺激，假赛，场外的阴谋诡计。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰米","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"这一切都是因为什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰米","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"再看看那些卡瓦莱利亚基之外的地方吧，感染者有何处可去？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......何处可去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰米","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"我们身患矿石病，绝症，我们迟早会死，我们的死还会给周围带来灾难。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰米","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"我们是不祥的，是不可控的，是被排斥的异类。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰米","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"监正会真的会允许感染者建立正规骑士团吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰米","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"卡西米尔......不，这片大地真的还有感染者存续的空间吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰米","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"就算有......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰米","speakerId":"avg_npc_220","isRemote":false,"text":"......又与你何干呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G05"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"无胄盟成员A","speakerId":"avg_npc_216","isRemote":false,"text":"这家伙，已经一动不动了啊......死了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"无胄盟成员B","speakerId":"avg_npc_216","isRemote":false,"text":"但愿吧，我是真的不想和感染者厮杀，要是我也被感染了怎么办......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"无胄盟成员B","speakerId":"avg_npc_216","isRemote":false,"text":"你去确认一下吧，如果真的死了，就让善后小组来处理。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......咳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说谁，死了呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......来啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"该死的......无胄盟！我要......打败你们所有人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"残害......感染者的......凶手！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"无胄盟成员A","speakerId":"avg_npc_216","isRemote":false,"text":"......她还有力气动？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"无胄盟成员A","speakerId":"avg_npc_216","isRemote":false,"text":"浑身是血，站都站不稳，何必勉强呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"来......来！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谁也别......想走......咳！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"无胄盟成员B","speakerId":"avg_npc_216","isRemote":false,"text":"......也算挺有骨气的，给她个痛快吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"无胄盟成员B","speakerId":"avg_npc_216","isRemote":false,"text":"反正再这样下去，过个几分钟她就要失血而死了，啧啧，莫妮克的手法还真娴熟。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"......\n如果，我更强的话，更快的话......\n是不是可以......\n逃离这个时代？\n......\n逃？\n不！我在想什么？\n快动起来......该死......为什么视野在模糊......\n睁眼啊......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G05"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"无胄盟成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_216","isRemote":false,"text":"放心吧，你很快就会解脱——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"无胄盟的动作突然停了下来。\n脚步声。\n厚重的脚步声，不同于这些杀手的轻巧，仿佛背负着千斤重石的脚步声。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"无胄盟成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_216","isRemote":false,"text":"（模糊的对话）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（他们......在说什么......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"无胄盟成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_216","isRemote":false,"text":"（模糊的对话）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（......？他们为什么......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不......别走......站......住！我还......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......已经够了，骑士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你做得很好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G06"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"游客A","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么了？怎么突然一片漆黑！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"游客B","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"发生什么了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"哈！？怎么街道上全都没电了！？天呐，这要赔多少钱？？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，那边的骑士，来帮忙疏散观众啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G03"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿咻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"......唔啊，外面真的一片漆黑呢......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"格蕾纳蒂他们做得也太绝了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"不过......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"......联合会大楼有独立的电源......啧，时间不多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"唔！有人来了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企业员工A","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"刚才为什么断电了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企业员工B","speakerId":"avg_npc_222","isRemote":false,"text":"看外面！整座城市都——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企业员工A","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"难、难道又是动力炉出了问题......？大隔断？大隔断重演了吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人马克维茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别慌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企业员工A","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，马克维茨先生......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人马克维茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......万幸的是，今天正好是发言人会议。几位董事此刻也都在联合会大楼内，安然无恙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人麦基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没错。听从安排，疏导群众，立刻联系监正会代表，首要任务是确保治安不会出问题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人麦基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......各个城区应该有自己的备用电源，让各区负责人妥善处理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企业员工","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"是！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"......董事会议......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"不，当务之急是要找到机房的入口——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企业员工","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"青金阁下！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......事情闹得真大条啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以我早说了嘛，对待感染者就应该当机立断一些，不要给他们机会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"幸好今天董事们把我叫来了，不然各位老板出了什么岔子可怎么办？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人麦基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......事后会对这些事件进行复盘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没问题，但是现在无胄盟的大部分兵力......以及莫妮克都被派去围剿感染者了，现在赶回来恐怕要点时间......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"......！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人麦基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......明白了。那么在这期间，就麻烦你放下原本的任务，保证董事们的安全。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好，但我想......总不能有人真的对董事会出手吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G04"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"......围剿......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"不......他们不会有事的......我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"必须赶快。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G06"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......千万不要有事，艾沃娜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在哪里？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟奇亚克","speakerId":"avg_npc_103nc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"远牙！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......塑料骑士？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看见其他人了吗，他们摧毁了我们的通讯——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟奇亚克","speakerId":"avg_npc_103nc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没那么简单，这里可是城市中心，能切断我们的通讯，说明从一开始我们的通讯频段就被截获了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟奇亚克","speakerId":"avg_npc_103nc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"电力瘫痪也不是灰毫骑士做的，她还没来得及突击，动力炉就先一步遭到了袭击，现在，她已经赶去接应焰尾了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟奇亚克","speakerId":"avg_npc_103nc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"无胄盟......一直在打着什么算盘，而且一直在嫁祸给感染者——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟奇亚克","speakerId":"avg_npc_103nc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快找到其他人，我们的处境很危险！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G05"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"艾沃娜！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"高傲的感染者骑士倒在血泊之中。\n鲜血染红了她的铠甲。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"艾沃娜！醒醒！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还、还有呼吸......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟奇亚克","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查丝汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"瑟奇亚克，来搭把手——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟奇亚克","speakerId":"avg_npc_103nc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......慢着，这附近......有别的人来过？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟奇亚克","speakerId":"avg_npc_103nc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"无胄盟可没有使用战斧的刺客......就算有，这个痕迹......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟奇亚克","speakerId":"avg_npc_103nc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"墙面......在渗血？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟奇亚克","speakerId":"avg_npc_103nc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是他......？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_motorroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"......下载完成。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"这就是......零号地块的计划书......还有无胄盟的内部资料。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"......这么简单就得手，还真是让人不适应。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"先从这个鬼地方爬出去——啊，我的尾巴——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G03"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企业员工","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"别愣着！快去联系国民院的人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企业员工","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"还有你，你们部门不是应该负责炎刃竞技场的疏散吗？动起来啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡西米尔骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_219","isRemote":false,"text":"我们来接发言人小姐，她还在二楼吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"（一片混乱......正好。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"（但愿能顺利离开......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不会吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"（！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真有人敢趁乱混进联合会大楼吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"（被发现了——！？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"呜啊......！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"痛痛痛......这里是哪里......刚才原来靠在门边吗，我都没注意......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"好黑啊，呃，会议室吗......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"得找到出去的路——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"23_I04"},{"type":"narration","text":"索娜一直觉得自己在努力抗争着什么。\n对抗无胄盟，对抗商业联合会，对抗关于感染者的一切不公，对抗命运。\n她其实从未怀疑过自己行为的必要性。\n只是在这个瞬间，有一股从头到脚的寒意，令她一时有些动摇。\n这确实是她第一次动摇。\n就像盛夏时节看见一座如山的冰雕。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"铃声在响。\n回荡在空无一人的室内。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......喂？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"电话那头的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......焰尾骑士，索娜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"电话那头的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"辛苦你做了这一切。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......欸......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"电话那头的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你现在，有两个选择。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"电话那头的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"此时，“青金”罗伊就在你所处的会议室门外。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"电话那头的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"交易很简单。你手里有两份信息存储设备。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"电话那头的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"交出无胄盟的那份，零号地块的情报你可以带走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"电话那头的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这足够你们在监正会那里，换取合法生活的权利。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"电话那头的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我觉得你别无选择。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"电话那头的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"一切尽在把握，焰尾骑士。我无意针对感染者，更无意针对你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"电话那头的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"骑士也好，商人也好，感染者也好，都目光狭隘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"电话那头的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"别与社会为敌，感染者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"电话那头的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"服务器已经被我们摧毁，你手里的芯片即是最后的副本。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"电话那头的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"做出选择。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"............"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"电话那头的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"或者，你此刻正打算砸掉这台电话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"电话那头的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那就这么做吧，如果你觉得，这就是你反抗命运的答案的话——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......哇，他是不是猜到了？真厉害哎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那么，现在，青金就在门外，我该怎么办呢......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......这里是几楼来着？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"这——是不是——有点高！？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G04"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾纳蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"索娜！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"小灰！接住我！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾纳蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"——你又在做什么？那么高——哇——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"疼疼疼......还好用法术缓冲了一下......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾纳蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"干、干嘛这么看着我？好啦，我以后不乱来了......放开我的尾巴好吗......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾纳蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"......不，只是......你没事，太好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾纳蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"我们还没来得及突袭动力炉，就被人捷足先登了，有人在利用我们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"......没关系，至少我们要的东西拿到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"看！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾纳蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"这就是......这一个小小的数据芯片......就能决定我们的去向？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"现在只能祈祷它能了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......唔啊，这得有十几米吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还挺活蹦乱跳的啊，感染者，没吃够苦头吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾纳蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"......！你那装扮......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你认得我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"无胄盟的高层对于普通骑士而言一直是个谜......但是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"“青金”罗伊，这十多年来唯一一个没有更替过的青金杀手，你出现的传言逸闻多了，那大家就都认识你啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真的？哈哈，出名是很高兴啦，不过作为一个杀手太有名气，也不是好事，毕竟无胄盟和骑士不一样，名气可不能变现。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"交出芯片，活着离开。还是我杀了你们之后，再拿走芯片？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我个人是不太喜欢没钱的厮杀就是了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾纳蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"......索娜，你还好吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿咻，没事，但这可是一场苦战。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾纳蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"活下来就行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿，我们有多久没有真正并肩作战了？和钳兽战斗的时候？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......再怎么讲，也别把我和钳兽相提并论啊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_sportsbar"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"光头马丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_107","isRemote":false,"text":"还好准备了备用灯......没想到真会有派上用场的一天。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_120","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么了？又来一次大隔断不成？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老工匠","speakerId":"avg_npc_101","isRemote":false,"text":"外面真的都停电了！喂，开什么玩笑，这可是特锦赛期间！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"光头马丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_107","isRemote":false,"text":"电力很快就会恢复的......但是，究竟是谁，能让这座不夜城失去光辉......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_nearllivingroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛恩纳","speakerId":"avg_npc_108","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛恩纳","speakerId":"avg_npc_108","isRemote":false,"text":"......荒唐。真是荒唐。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
